			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"星火"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 210080000,
					"content": "火把怎么又熄灭了…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080001
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080001,
					"content": "火把怎么了？$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080002
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210080002,
					"content": "哦，是旅行者啊…你往前看，是不是能看见三座瞭望台？那上面本来应该燃着火把…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080003,
					"content": "归离原的道路都很不好走，而且还有很多怪物躲藏。火把一方面是为行人们照亮道路，另一方面，燃起火把也是表示没有怪物的威胁。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080004,
					"content": "但是…我忙着去周围清除怪物，偏偏忘了给火把续上火，等我发现的时候，已经全都熄灭了。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2100801,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": []
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"星火"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 210080101,
					"content": "你为什么不自己去…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210080102,
					"content": "呃，是这样，会有人来抽查火把的情况…我在这里还能拖一拖时间…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080103,
					"content": "要是你站在这，或者这里根本没人，那不就糟糕了吗？$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080104,
					"content": "所以，拜托你了旅行者！去点燃火把吧！$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2100802,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2100801
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": []
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"星火"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 210080201,
					"content": "交给我吧。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210080202,
					"content": "那就拜托你了！$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080203,
					"content": "这条路上有三座嘹望塔，每座塔上分别有一个火盆。把它们都点燃以后，回来跟我说一声就行了。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080204,
					"content": "在道路的尽头，有一座「七天神像」。你或许可以顺道供奉一下，那可是岩王爷的护佑啊。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080205,
					"content": "无论怎样……这件事就拜托你了，顺路的时候记得过去看看，别忘了哦。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2100803,
			"completionStepIds": [],
